                    <span>🛍️</span> เลือกรายการสินค้า
                </h2>
                <div class="text-sm font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200">
                    เลือกแล้ว: <span id="totalCountDisplay">0</span> / 5 ชิ้น
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="productList" class="space-y-4">
                <!-- Items will be injected by JavaScript -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Order Summary & Payment Section -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md p-5 md:p-6 mb-6 border border-amber-100">
            <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>💳</span> ช่องทางการชำระเงิน
            </h2>
            
            <div class="bg-amber-50/60 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-amber-200/60 mb-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-xl shadow-sm border">
                    <img src="image_3.png" alt="QR Payment" class="w-36 h-36 object-contain">
                </div>
                <div class="text-center sm:text-left space-y-2">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-semibold">
                        <span>🏦</span> ธนาคารกสิกรไทย (KBank)
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">ชื่อบัญชี: <span class="font-bold text-stone-900">รัตนมณี แสงเมล์</span></div>
                    <div class="text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-2">
                        เลขบัญชี: <span id="accNumber" class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-base">0991512365</span>
                        <button onclick="copyAccNumber()" class="bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg transition font-medium">คัดลอก</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">โอนเงินแล้วแนบสลิปและตรวจสอบยอดรวมด้านล่างได้เลยค่ะ</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bill Calculation Box -->
            <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-xl p-4 border mb-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-stone-600">ราคารวมสินค้า:</span>
                    <span id="sumGoodsPrice" class="font-medium">0 บาท</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-stone-600">ค่าหิ้วรวม:</span>
                    <span id="sumHandlingFee" class="font-medium">0 บาท</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    <span class="text-stone-600">ค่าจัดส่ง:</span>
                    <span id="sumShippingFee" class="font-medium">45 บาท</span>
                </div>
                <div class="border-t pt-2 flex justify-between text-base font-bold text-amber-900">
                    <span>ยอดรวมทั้งสิ้นที่ต้องชำระ:</span>
                    <span id="grandTotal">0 บาท</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Slip Upload -->
            <div class="mb-6">
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-1">อัปโหลดหลักฐานการชำระเงิน (สลิปโอนเงิน) <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                <input type="file" id="slipFile" accept="image/*" class="w-full text-sm text-stone-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-amber-100 file:text-amber-800 hover:file:bg-amber-200 cursor-pointer border rounded-xl p-1">
            </div>

            <!-- Action Buttons -->
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
                <a href="https://lin.ee/r60tJWt" target="_blank" class="flex-1 bg-stone-200 hover:bg-stone-300 text-stone-800 text-center py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold transition text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <span>💬</span> ติดต่อร้านใน LINE
                </a>
                <button onclick="submitOrder()" class="flex-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white py-3 px-6 rounded-xl font-semibold transition text-sm shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                    <span>🚀</span> ส่งคำสั่งซื้อเข้า LINE ร้านค้า
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Admin / Backoffice Modal -->
    <div id="adminModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/60 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto p-6 shadow-2xl relative">
            <button onclick="closeAdminModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-600 text-xl font-bold">✕</button>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>⚙️</span> ระบบจัดการหลังบ้านร้านค้า
            </h2>

            <div class="flex border-b mb-4">
                <button onclick="switchTab('stock')" id="tabStockBtn" class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-amber-700 border-b-2 border-amber-600 text-sm">จัดการสต็อกสินค้า</button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('orders')" id="tabOrderBtn" class="px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-stone-500 text-sm">สรุปยอดออเดอร์</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 1: Stock Management -->
            <div id="stockTabContent" class="space-y-3">
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">กำหนดจำนวนสินค้าคงเหลือเริ่มต้น (ระบบจะตัดสต็อกอัตโนมัติเมื่อลูกค้ายืนยันออเดอร์)</p>
                <div id="adminStockList" class="space-y-2 max-h-96 overflow-y-auto pr-2"></div>
                <button onclick="saveStockChanges()" class="w-full bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition mt-3">บันทึกการเปลี่ยนแปลงสต็อก</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 2: Orders Summary -->
            <div id="orderTabContent" class="space-y-4 hidden">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-800 text-sm">รายงานยอดสั่งซื้อแยกตามรายการ</h3>
                    <button onclick="exportSummaryImage()" class="bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-900 text-white text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition font-medium flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <span>📥</span> บันทึกรูปภาพสรุปออเดอร์
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div id="summaryReportContainer" class="bg-stone-50 p-4 rounded-xl border space-y-4">
                    <div id="summaryItemsList" class="space-y-2 text-sm"></div>
                    <div class="border-t pt-3 flex justify-between font-bold text-sm">
                        <span>จำนวนออเดอร์ทั้งหมด: <span id="totalOrdersCount">0</span> รายการ</span>
                        <span>ยอดขายรวม: <span id="totalSalesSum">0</span> บาท</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="font-bold text-stone-800 text-sm pt-2">ประวัติคำสั่งซื้อทั้งหมด</h3>
                <div id="customerOrdersHistory" class="space-y-3 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto pr-2"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Initial Products Data
        const defaultProducts = [
            { id: 1, name: "Random Photocards: Duang With You - OST. Edition", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 2, name: "Random Photocards: Take Our Time", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 3, name: "Random Photocards: It Had To Be You", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 4, name: "Random Photocards: Next Status", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 5, name: "Random Photocards: 101% Love", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 6, name: "Random Photocards: Skinship Collection", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 7, name: "Random Photocards: Khemira Tour 4 Regions", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 8, name: "Random Photocards: My No.1 Duo", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 9, name: "Random Photocards: DMD Partners", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 10, name: "Random Selfie Photocards: DMD Songkran 2026", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 11, name: "Random Photocards - DEXX", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 12, name: "Random Photocards - Final EP.", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 13, name: "Random Selfie Photocards - Ver.A", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 14, name: "Random Selfie Photocards - Ver.B", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 15, name: "Random Film Photocards", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            
            // Bag Hangers
            { id: 16, name: "Bag Hanger - A: Nongzon", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 17, name: "Bag Hanger - B: Chae", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 18, name: "Bag Hanger - C: Rainy", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 19, name: "Bag Hanger - D: Heartdy", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 20, name: "Bag Hanger - E: Aunor", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 21, name: "Bag Hanger - F: Jookkoo", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 22, name: "Bag Hanger - G: Mritoky", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 23, name: "Bag Hanger - H: Whipraew", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 24, name: "Bag Hanger - I: Tamik", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 25, name: "Bag Hanger - J: Boksar", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 26, name: "Bag Hanger - K: Jessy", price: 290, type: "general", stock: 10 },

            // Phone Charms
            { id: 27, name: "Phone Charm - A: Nongzon", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 28, name: "Phone Charm - B: Chae", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 29, name: "Phone Charm - C: Rainy", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 30, name: "Phone Charm - D: Heartdy", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 31, name: "Phone Charm - E: Aunor", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 32, name: "Phone Charm - F: Jookkoo", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 33, name: "Phone Charm - G: Mritoky", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 34, name: "Phone Charm - H: Whipraew", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 35, name: "Phone Charm - I: Tamik", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 36, name: "Phone Charm - J: Boksar", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },
            { id: 37, name: "Phone Charm - K: Jessy", price: 390, type: "general", stock: 10 },

            // Apparel (Shirts)
            { id: 38, name: "DEXX Shadow Fade Sweater", price: 1090, type: "apparel", stock: 10 },
            { id: 39, name: "DEXX Distressed T-Shirt", price: 790, type: "apparel", stock: 10 }
        ];

        let products = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('domundi_products')) || defaultProducts;
        let orders = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('domundi_orders')) || [];

        function saveProductsToStorage() {
            localStorage.setItem('domundi_products', JSON.stringify(products));
        }

        function saveOrdersToStorage() {
            localStorage.setItem('domundi_orders', JSON.stringify(orders));
        }

        function renderProducts() {
            const container = document.getElementById('productList');
            container.innerHTML = '';

            products.forEach(p => {
                let fee = p.type === 'apparel' ? 80 : 60;
                let isOut = p.stock <= 0;
                let div = document.createElement('div');
                div.className = `flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center p-3 rounded-xl border ${isOut ? 'bg-stone-100 opacity-60' : 'bg-white hover:border-amber-300'} transition`;
                div.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="mb-2 sm:mb-0">
                        <div class="font-medium text-sm text-stone-900">${p.name}</div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-stone-500">ราคา: ${p.price} บาท | ค่าหิ้ว: ${fee} บาท ${isOut ? '<span class="text-red-500 font-semibold">(สินค้าหมด)</span>' : '<span class="text-emerald-600 font-medium">(เหลือ ' + p.stock + ' ชิ้น)</span>'}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full sm:w-auto justify-between sm:justify-end">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-1 rounded">รวม: ${(p.price + fee)} ฿</span>
                        <input type="number" min="0" max="5" value="0" data-id="${p.id}" ${isOut ? 'disabled' : ''} onchange="calculateTotal()" class="item-qty w-16 px-2 py-1 border rounded-lg text-center text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 focus:outline-none">
                    </div>
                `;
                container.appendChild(div);
            });
            calculateTotal();
        }

        function calculateTotal() {
            let qtyInputs = document.querySelectorAll('.item-qty');
            let totalQty = 0;
            let goodsPrice = 0;
            let handlingFee = 0;

            qtyInputs.forEach(input => {
                let qty = parseInt(input.value) || 0;
                if(qty > 0) {
                    totalQty += qty;
                    let id = parseInt(input.getAttribute('data-id'));
                    let prod = products.find(p => p.id === id);
                    if(prod) {
                        goodsPrice += prod.price * qty;
                        let fee = prod.type === 'apparel' ? 80 : 60;
                        handlingFee += fee * qty;
                    }
                }
            });

            document.getElementById('totalCountDisplayinnerText' || 'totalCountDisplay').innerText = totalQty;

            if(totalQty > 5) {
                alert('⚠️ จำกัดการสั่งซื้อรวมไม่เกิน 5 ชิ้นต่อ 1 คำสั่งซื้อ กรุณาลดจำนวนลงค่ะ');
            }

            let shippingMethod = document.getElementById('shippingMethod').value;
            let shippingFee = shippingMethod === 'delivery' ? 45 : 0;
            document.getElementById('sumShippingFee').innerText = shippingFee + ' บาท';

            document.getElementById('sumGoodsPrice').innerText = goodsPrice + ' บาท';
            document.getElementById('sumHandlingFee').innerText = handlingFee + ' บาท';
            let grandTotal = goodsPrice + handlingFee + shippingFee;
            document.getElementById('grandTotal').innerText = grandTotal + ' บาท';
        }

        function copyAccNumber() {
            let acc = document.getElementById('accNumber').innerText;
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(acc).then(() => {
                alert('คัดลอกเลขบัญชีสำเร็จ: ' + acc);
            });
        }

        function openAdminModal() {
            let pass = prompt('กรุณากรอกรหัสผ่านผู้ดูแลระบบ:');
            if(pass === '627183') {
                document.getElementById('adminModal').classList.remove('hidden');
                renderAdminStock();
                renderAdminOrders();
            } else if(pass !== null) {
                alert('รหัสผ่านไม่ถูกต้อง!');
            }
        }

        function closeAdminModal() {
            document.getElementById('adminModal').classList.add('hidden');
        }

        function switchTab(tab) {
            if(tab === 'stock') {
                document.getElementById('stockTabContent').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('orderTabContent').classList.add('hidden');
                document.getElementById('tabStockBtn').className = "px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-amber-700 border-b-2 border-amber-600 text-sm";
                document.getElementById('tabOrderBtn').className = "px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-stone-500 text-sm";
            } else {
                document.getElementById('stockTabContent').classList.add('hidden');
                document.getElementById('orderTabContent').classList.remove('hidden');
                document.getElementById('tabStockBtn').className = "px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-stone-500 text-sm";
                document.getElementById('tabOrderBtn').className = "px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-amber-700 border-b-2 border-amber-600 text-sm";
                renderAdminOrders();
            }
        }

        function renderAdminStock() {
            let container = document.getElementById('adminStockList');
            container.innerHTML = '';
            products.forEach(p => {
                let div = document.createElement('div');
                div.className = "flex items-center justify-between p-2 border rounded-lg bg-stone-50 text-sm";
                div.innerHTML = `
                    <span class="font-medium text-stone-800 truncate max-w-[240px]">${p.name}</span>
                    <input type="number" id="stock-input-${p.id}" value="${p.stock}" min="0" class="w-20 px-2 py-1 border rounded text-center">
                `;
                container.appendChild(div);
            });
        }

        function saveStockChanges() {
            products.forEach(p => {
                let input = document.getElementById(`stock-input-${p.id}`);
                if(input) {
                    p.stock = parseInt(input.value) || 0;
                }
            });
            saveProductsToStorage();
            renderProducts();
            alert('บันทึกสต็อกสำเร็จ!');
        }

        function renderAdminOrders() {
            let historyContainer = document.getElementById('customerOrdersHistory');
            historyContainer.innerHTML = '';

            let itemSummaryMap = {};
            let totalSales = 0;

            if(orders.length === 0) {
                historyContainer.innerHTML = '<p class="text-xs text-stone-400 text-center py-4">ยังไม่มีคำสั่งซื้อในระบบ</p>';
                document.getElementById('summaryItemsList').innerHTML = '<p class="text-xs text-stone-400 text-center">ยังไม่มีข้อมูลยอดขาย</p>';
                document.getElementById('totalOrdersCount').innerText = 0;
                document.getElementById('totalSalesSum').innerText = 0;
                return;
            }

            orders.forEach((ord, index) => {
                totalSales += ord.grandTotal;
                
                // Aggregate items
                ord.items.forEach(it => {
                    if(!itemSummaryMap[it.name]) {
                        itemSummaryMap[it.name] = 0;
                    }
                    itemSummaryMap[it.name] += it.qty;
                });

                let div = document.createElement('div');
                div.className = "bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs space-y-1";
                div.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="flex justify-between font-bold text-stone-800">
                        <span>ออเดอร์ #${index+1} - ${ord.name} (${ord.phone})</span>
                        <button onclick="deleteOrder(${index})" class="text-red-500 hover:text-red-700 font-medium">ลบออเดอร์</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-stone-600">ที่อยู่: ${ord.address}</div>
                    <div class="text-stone-600">รายการ: ${ord.items.map(i => i.name + ' x' + i.qty).join(', ')}</div>
                    <div class="font-semibold text-amber-900">ยอดรวม: ${ord.grandTotal} บาท (${ord.shipping === 'delivery' ? 'จัดส่งพัสดุ' : 'รับที่บูธ'})</div>
                `;
                historyContainer.appendChild(div);
            });

            document.getElementById('totalOrdersCount').innerText = orders.length;
            document.getElementById('totalSalesSum').innerText = totalSales;

            let summaryListEl = document.getElementById('summaryItemsList');
            summaryListEl.innerHTML = '';
            for(let itemName in itemSummaryMap) {
                let row = document.createElement('div');
                row.className = "flex justify-between border-b pb-1";
                row.innerHTML = `<span>${itemName}</span> <span class="font-bold">x ${itemSummaryMap[itemName]} ชิ้น</span>`;
                summaryListEl.appendChild(row);
            }
        }

        function deleteOrder(index) {
            if(confirm('ต้องการลบออเดอร์นี้ใช่หรือไม่? (ระบบจะทำการคืนสต็อกสินค้าให้ด้วยอัตโนมัติ)')) {
                let ord = orders[index];
                // Return stock
                ord.items.forEach(it => {
                    let prod = products.find(p => p.id === it.id);
                    if(prod) {
                        prod.stock += it.qty;
                    }
                });
                saveProductsToStorage();
                orders.splice(index, 1);
                saveOrdersToStorage();
                renderProducts();
                renderAdminOrders();
                alert('ลบออเดอร์และคืนสต็อกสำเร็จ');
            }
        }

        function exportSummaryImage() {
            let container = document.getElementById('summaryReportContainer');
            html2canvas(container).then(canvas => {
                let link = document.createElement('a');
                link.download = 'summary-report.png';
                link.href = canvas.toDataURL();
                link.click();
            });
        }

        function submitOrder() {
            let name = document.getElementById('custName').value.trim();
            let social = document.getElementById('custSocial').value.trim();
            let phone = document.getElementById('custPhone').value.trim();
            let address = document.getElementById('custAddress').value.trim();
            let shipping = document.getElementById('shippingMethod').value;
            let slip = document.getElementById('slipFile').files[0];

            if(!name || !phone || !address) {
                alert('กรุณากรอกข้อมูลผู้สั่งซื้อให้ครบถ้วน (ชื่อ, เบอร์โทร, ที่อยู่)');
                return;
            }

            let qtyInputs = document.querySelectorAll('.item-qty');
            let totalQty = 0;
            let orderedItems = [];
            let goodsPrice = 0;
            let handlingFee = 0;

            qtyInputs.forEach(input => {
                let qty = parseInt(input.value) || 0;
                if(qty > 0) {
                    totalQty += qty;
                    let id = parseInt(input.getAttribute('data-id'));
                    let prod = products.find(p => p.id === id);
                    if(prod) {
                        orderedItems.push({ id: prod.id, name: prod.name, qty: qty, price: prod.price });
                        goodsPrice += prod.price * qty;
                        let fee = prod.type === 'apparel' ? 80 : 60;
                        handlingFee += fee * qty;
                        
                        // Deduct stock
                        prod.stock -= qty;
                    }
                }
            });

            if(totalQty === 0) {
                alert('กรุณาเลือกสินค้าอย่างน้อย 1 รายการค่ะ');
                return;
            }

            if(totalQty > 5) {
                alert('จำกัดการซื้อไม่เกิน 5 ชิ้นต่อออเดอร์ค่ะ');
                return;
            }

            let shippingFee = shipping === 'delivery' ? 45 : 0;
            let grandTotal = goodsPrice + handlingFee + shippingFee;

            // Save order to localStorage
            let newOrder = {
                name: name,
                social: social || '-',
                phone: phone,
                address: address,
                shipping: shipping,
                items: orderedItems,
                grandTotal: grandTotal,
                date: new Date().toLocaleString()
            };

            orders.push(newOrder);
            saveOrdersToStorage();
            saveProductsToStorage();
            renderProducts();

            // Construct LINE Message
            let msg = `🛒 *คำสั่งซื้อ DOMUNDI POP-UP BOOTH*%0A`;
            msg += `-----------------------------------%0A`;
            msg += `👤 ชื่อ: ${name}%0A`;
            msg += `📱 IG/X: ${social || '-'0}%0A`;
            msg += `📞 เบอร์โทร: ${phone}%0A`;
            msg += `🏠 ที่อยู่: ${address}%0A`;
            msg += `🚚 การจัดส่ง: ${shipping === 'delivery' ? 'จัดส่งพัสดุ (+45)' : 'รับที่บูธ (0)'}%0A`;
            msg += `-----------------------------------%0A`;
            msg += `📦 *รายการสินค้า:*%0A`;
            orderedItems.forEach(i => {
                msg += `- ${i.name} x${i.qty} (${i.price * i.qty}฿)%0A`;
            });
            msg += `-----------------------------------%0A`;
            msg += `💰 ราคารวมสินค้า: ${goodsPrice} ฿%0A`;
            msg += `🏷️ ค่าหิ้วรวม: ${handlingFee} ฿%0A`;
            msg += `📦 ค่าส่ง: ${shippingFee} ฿%0A`;
            msg += `💵 *ยอดโอนทั้งสิ้น: ${grandTotal} บาท*%0A`;
            msg += `-----------------------------------%0A`;
            msg += `📌 แจ้งโอนเงินเรียบร้อยแล้ว (แนบสลิปในแชท LINE นี้ได้เลยค่ะ)`;

            if(!slip) {
                alert('แนะนำให้อัปโหลดสลิปโอนเงินก่อนส่ง เพื่อความรวดเร็วในการตรวจสอบครับ');
            }

            // Open LINE OA
            window.open(`https://lin.ee/r60tJWt`, '_blank');
            
            // Open pre-filled text or prompt user
            setTimeout(() => {
                navigator.clipboard.writeText(decodeURIComponent(msg.replace(/%0A/g, '\n')));
                alert('ระบบได้คัดลอกรายละเอียดคำสั่งซื้อของคุณเรียบร้อยแล้ว!\nกรุณาวางข้อความ (Paste) ส่งเข้าในแชท LINE ร้านค้า พร้อมแนบรูปสลิปโอนเงินได้เลยค่ะ');
            }, 500);
        }

        // Initial load
        renderProducts();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
